Cost: 0

Effects:
* Deal 2 DMG to all enemies. (Post Beta 39.1)
* Deal 1 DMG to all enemies. Repeat for each empty board slot you have. (Post Beta 42.0)
* Deal DMG equal to the amount of empty board slots you have...
** to all enemy monsters. (Post Beta 42.1)
** to all enemies. (Post Beta 43.0, Current)
